        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `stream_chunks.py` that streams audio chunks from an async source, I will use the AWS S3 service as the concrete external provider. This will involve importing the `boto3` library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, to interact with S3. The code will include a function to stream audio chunks from an S3 bucket. </thinking>\n",
